#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: msc-stealth-login.php includes/class-msc-stealth-login-settings.php:323
msgid "MSC Stealth Login"
msgstr "MSC Stealth Login"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: msc-stealth-login.php
msgid "https://github.com/djm56/msc-stealth-login"
msgstr "https://github.com/djm56/msc-stealth-login"

#. Description of the plugin
#: msc-stealth-login.php
msgid ""
"Hide your login page, block brute force attacks, and protect your WordPress "
"site from unauthorized access. Complete free plugin with all features "
"included."
msgstr ""
"Скройте свою страницу входа, блокируйте атаки методом подбора и защитите "
"свой сайт WordPress от несанкционированного доступа. Полностью бесплатный "
"плагин со всеми включёнными функциями."

#. Author of the plugin
#: msc-stealth-login.php
msgid "Anomalous Developers"
msgstr "Anomalous Developers"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: msc-stealth-login.php
msgid "https://anomalous.co.za"
msgstr "https://anomalous.co.za"

